Package: poulsbo-sgx
Version: 1.0.0
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: poulsbo-sgx-modules (= 1.0.0), poulsbo-sgx-userspace (= 1.0.0)
Maintainer: Poulsbo project <marcinkeviciusjustinas@gmail.com>
Description: Poulsbo GMA500 / SGX535 accelerated graphics stack (metapackage)
 Installs the complete Poulsbo SGX535 driver: the kernel modules
 (poulsbo-sgx-modules) and the EGL/GLES2 + EXA userspace
 (poulsbo-sgx-userspace).  After installing this package and rebooting, the
 GMA500 comes up with 2D acceleration under X11 and OpenGL ES on the SGX535.
